# ART-SK-HILLBTWN -- W3-FIX-A art acceptance. The default lobby map
# (hillbtwn.map, URBAN) places 55 civilian buildings whose art exists only in
# YR ra2md.mix (isourbmd/isogenmd: CALA07-15, CAURB01/02, CAPARK04-06, ...);
# the AssetFS YR tail draws them (no empty plazas / parking lots).
set render_every 600
set on_quit continue
click button "Single Player"
click button Skirmish
require scene == lobby
click start
until 120 scene == game
require scene == game
wait 10
cheat reveal
cheat art_dump
assert art.dressing_missing == 0
assert art.missing == 0
cheat view_building CALA07
wait 2
shot cala07
cheat view_dressing CAURB01
wait 2
shot caurb01
cheat view_dressing CAPARK04
wait 2
shot capark04
